      ],
      "image": "assets/images/12386/step_01.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Whisk self-rising flour, sugar, and milk together in a bowl until well combined and no lumps remain.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/i8mVYywLhVZbQjhmtYtlY090Ipo=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/12386-QuickandEasyPeachCobbler-mfs-step3-0097-3723b7503f2941bd821d76f1971046a2.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/12386/step_02.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Pour melted butter into a 2-quart baking dish (or a 9- or 10-inch cast-iron skillet); pour flour-milk mixture over top.",
